<title>USA: SIOUX FALLS CATTLE STEADY/$0.50 HIGHER - USDA.</title>
<headline>SIOUX FALLS CATTLE STEADY/$0.50 HIGHER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were steady-$0.50 higher. Offerings light. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1200-1400 lbs 64.50-66.00. Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 63.50-64.50. Select 1-2 62.50-63.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1025-1150 lbs 64.00-65.00. Select and Choice 2-3 950-1100 lbs 63.00-64.00, occasionally 64.50. Select 1-2 61.00-63.00.</p>
</text>
